<title>USA: Granite Development to spin off RAMA.</title>
<headline>Granite Development to spin off RAMA.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite Development Corp said on Monday that its board of directors confirmed the spinoff of its RAMA Financial Corp subsidiary.</p>
<p>This action calls for five percent of the RAMA shares to be distributed as a dividend to all existing Granite shareholders of record as of June 9, 1997.</p>
<p>Granite said there should be no adverse tax ramifications to Granite shareholders from this distribution.</p>
